<title>NETHERLANDS: Dutch shares closed for holiday, reopen May 1.</title>
<headline>Dutch shares closed for holiday, reopen May 1.</headline>
<dateline>AMSTERDAM 1997-04-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Dutch stock market is closed on Wednesday for the Koninginnedag (Queen's Day) national holiday and will reopen on Thursday, May 1.</p>
<p>Shares closed sharply higher on Tuesday ahead of the holiday, with the AEX index of leading shares up 13.58 points to 763.34.</p>
<p>--Amsterdam Newsroom +31 20 504 5000, fax +31 20 504 5040</p>
